      "isStoreEnforced" : true,
      "name" : "joinStudio",
      "title" : "Joining a studio"
    },
    {
      "blurb" : "Assign a piece with a weekly target and the instructions you would give in the room: hands separate, take it at 72, sticking as written. They have it on Tuesday night when you are not there.",
