      "isStoreEnforced" : true,
      "name" : "assignWork",
      "title" : "Assigning the work"
    },
    {
      "blurb" : "A performer starts a session before they play and stops it when they are done, so the time is counted rather than remembered. Sessions are saved on the phone first, so a practice room with no signal never loses one.",
