      "isStoreEnforced" : true,
      "name" : "logPractice",
      "title" : "Logging a session"
    },
    {
      "blurb" : "The performer plays their own click out loud and the take catches both, so their instructor can hear how the two line up. They mark the moments worth hearing, which turns a four-minute recording into a ten-second listen.",
