      "isStoreEnforced" : false,
      "name" : "recordTake",
      "title" : "Recording a take"
    },
    {
      "blurb" : "Each instruction on the plan gets ticked off as it is worked. It is deliberately worth no points, because a self-report you pay for stops being information.",
      "isPurchasable" : true,
      "isStoreEnforced" : true,
      "name" : "markFocusPoint",
      "title" : "Ticking off the plan"
    },
    {
      "blurb" : "You hear a take and send one line back. This is the step every rival product is missing, and a performer who thinks nobody listens stops recording inside a fortnight.",
      "isPurchasable" : true,
      "isStoreEnforced" : true,
      "name" : "acknowledgeSession",
      "title" : "Saying you heard it"
    },
    {
      "blurb" : "One line to one performer, with no thread and no reply. It reaches somebody who has gone quiet without turning the app into a chat client.",
      "isPurchasable" : true,
      "isStoreEnforced" : true,
      "name" : "sendNudge",
      "title" : "Sending one line"
    },
    {
      "blurb" : "Promote an assistant to instructor, move somebody between sections, or remove a performer who has left. A second adult in the room is the normal case, not the edge one.",
      "isPurchasable" : true,
      "isStoreEnforced" : true,
      "name" : "manageRoster",
      "title" : "Running the roster"
    },
    {
      "blurb" : "Tune what earns points, or switch the leaderboard off entirely. Running a studio without one is a first-class choice. What cannot be done is letting raw minutes outscore finishing the work.",
